{"id": "71709", "title": "我不狠，站不稳", "author": "墨涵元宝", "category": "都市言情", "count": 45, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/71/71709.htm", "intro": "前世她是医学院顶尖高材生，重生却是下堂妇之女。\n    梁嫤岂会甘心！\n    她扶持娘亲，教养幼弟，用尽所学开医馆，悬壶济世，惩奸除恶！\n    绿茶，心机，全能婊，斗斗斗，姐不怕，批斗更爽更痛快！\n    大宅院深，人心叵测！\n    官场水深，危机四伏！\n    正当她斗的风生水起，医的热火朝天之时，\n    传闻颜值爆表，不近女色的世子爷偏偏插一脚！\n    世子爷将她压在医馆诊案上，嘴角含笑眼底冰冷道：“梁大神医给诊诊，为何我对天下女子皆抵触，唯独你除外？”\n    梁嫤一脸嫌弃的避开：“早闻世子爷有此隐疾，莫非您更喜男色？”", "base": "files/article/html/71/71709", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第1章 砸人", "file": "11252218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章 救治", "file": "11252219.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章 赔礼", "file": "11252220.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章 挨骂", "file": "11252221.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章 纨绔", "file": "11252222.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6章 看诊", "file": "11252223.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7章 调戏", "file": "11252224.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章 故意", "file": "11252225.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9章 盗窃", "file": "11252226.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章 脱困", "file": "11252227.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章 做丫鬟", "file": "11252228.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12章 嫉妒", "file": "11252229.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13章 相克", "file": "11252230.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14章 玉碎", "file": "11252231.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15章 卖身", "file": "11252232.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16章 嫉妒", "file": "11252233.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17章 讨好", "file": "11252234.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18章 银针", "file": "11252235.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19章 依仗", "file": "11252236.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20章 沐浴", "file": "11252237.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21章 报复", "file": "11252238.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22章 吃亏", "file": "11252239.html"